      "codeSnippet": "var arr = new String[] { \"PIG\", \"pig\", \"123\"};\r\nArrays.sort(arr);\r\nSystem.out.println(Arrays.toString(arr));\r\nSystem.out.println(Arrays.binarySearch(arr, \"Pippa\"));",
