      "codeSnippet": "record Walrus(List<String> diet) {}\r\nrecord Exhibit(Walrus animal, String location) {}\r\n \r\nvar e = new Exhibit(new Walrus(List.of(\"Wally\")), \"Artic\");\r\nSystem.out.print(e instanceof _____________);",
