      "codeSnippet": "Function<Integer, Integer> s = a -> a + 4;\r\nFunction<Integer, Integer> t = a -> a * 3;\r\nFunction<Integer, Integer> c = s.compose(t);\r\nSystem.out.print(c.apply(1));",
